{"story_id":85938,"updated_at":"2026-11-20T00:39:39","headline_en":"Anthropic hits $2.01 trillion valuation in world's largest stock market debut","headline_hi":"एन्थ्रोपिक ने दुनिया के सबसे बड़े शेयर बाजार में पदार्पण पर $2.01 ट्रिलियन का मूल्यांकन हासिल किया","payload_en":{"story_id":85938,"headline":"Anthropic hits $2.01 trillion valuation in world's largest stock market debut","counts":{"articles":12,"independent_sources":8,"outlets":10},"has_established":false,"qualified_by":"interim","perspective_mode":"none","perspectives":{"–":["Al Jazeera","DW","Dawn","Fox Business","France 24","Gulf News","Hindustan Times","The National","The Weekly Times","iPhone in Canada"]},"framing":[],"suicide":false,"thread":85938,"parents":[],"children":[],"written_at":"2026-11-20T00:39:39","category":{"v":2,"primary":["business"],"secondary":["companies","markets"],"tertiary":["results","stocks"]},"places":[],"people":["Dario Amodei","Dan Ives of Yorkville Ives & Co","Elizabeth Warren","Founders ETF","Malik Ahmed Khan","Michael Monaghan","Nasdaq","New York"],"narrative":{"paragraphs":[[{"text":"On 19 November, anthropic's valuation at the start of trading was $2.01 trillion.","ids":[150044],"class":"partial","sources":[1,2,3,4]}],[{"text":"Anthropic began trading on the Nasdaq stock exchange yesterday.","ids":[150058],"class":"unverified","sources":[1,2,3,4,5,6,7,8]},{"text":"It began trading at $111.50 yesterday.","ids":[150042],"class":"unverified","sources":[1,4,5,7]}],[{"text":"Dario Amodei gave a speech before markets opened.","ids":[150048],"class":"single","sources":[8]}],[{"text":"Anthropic was not yet making a profit.","ids":[150095],"class":"single","sources":[5]}],[{"text":"On Thursday, Amodei said the stock market debut would strengthen the company's finances and commitment to acting responsibly, adding that Anthropic's intelligence was being applied to stimulate economic growth.","ids":[150071,150052],"class":"single","sources":[4,8]}],[{"text":"\"At $83 per share, Anthropic is coming to market above its initial pricing range, but still below our $92 fair value estimate,\" Malik Ahmed Khan said.","ids":[150054],"class":"single","sources":[8]}],[{"text":"Anthropic's valuation is $1.5 trillion.","ids":[150080],"class":"single","sources":[6]}],[{"text":"Dan Ives of Yorkville Ives & Co stated that \"Anthropic’s IPO is a big near-term win for the tech sector and should help restore some investor confidence.\"","ids":[150082],"class":"single","sources":[6]}],[{"text":"US Democratic Senator Elizabeth Warren criticised the listing, stating that it \"fails to answer for the potential threats to Americans’ retirements and the entire financial system if this IPO goes awry.\"","ids":[150083],"class":"single","sources":[6]}],[{"text":"Michael Monaghan, founder and portfolio manager at Founders ETF, stated, \"We have indicated our intention to buy in the IPO and hope to get an allocation.\"","ids":[150063],"class":"single","sources":[2]}],[{"text":"Anthropic priced its IPO at $83 per share yesterday, and it offered 980 million shares to the public yesterday.","ids":[150043,150045],"class":"single","sources":[1,3,4,6,7,8]},{"text":"Reports said it sold $107 billion in shares in total yesterday, while newer reports show it sold 980 million shares at $83 each yesterday.","ids":[150051,150060],"class":"single","sources":[2,8]}],[{"text":"Anthropic's IPO raised $81 billion yesterday, it raised $79.4 billion in its offering yesterday, and it offered 980 million shares at $83 per share yesterday.","ids":[150074,150081,150090],"parts":[{"text":"Anthropic's IPO raised $81 billion yesterday,","ids":[150074],"class":"partial"},{"text":"it raised $79.4 billion in its offering yesterday,","ids":[150081],"class":"single"},{"text":"and it offered 980 million shares at $83 per share yesterday.","ids":[150090],"class":"single"}],"class":"single","sources":[4,5,6]}],[{"text":"The trading price of Anthropic shares reached $111.50 yesterday, and stock traded at 11:50am in New York yesterday.","ids":[150069,150100],"class":"single","sources":[2,3]}],[{"text":"Anthropic's company value is about $1.5 trillion yesterday, fully diluted valuation sits at around $1.5 trillion yesterday, and valuation is $2 trillion yesterday.","ids":[150050,150077,150089],"class":"single","sources":[5,7,8]}],[{"text":"The opening price was 34% higher than the IPO price of $83 yesterday.","ids":[150088],"class":"partial","sources":[3,5]}]],"section_keys":["news","happened","happened","happened","say","say","say","say","say","say","numbers","numbers","numbers","numbers","numbers"],"sources":[{"n":1,"url":"https://gulfnews.com/business/markets/anthropic-shares-surge-over-30-in-worlds-biggest-ipo-valuation-tops-2-trillion-1.500754119","outlet":"Gulf News","title":"Anthropic shares surge over 30% in world's biggest IPO, valuation tops $2 trillion","perspective":"–","read":true,"readable":true},{"n":2,"url":"https://www.aljazeera.com/economy/2026/11/19/anthropic-starts-trading-in-the-us-after-blockbuster-ipo?traffic_source=rss","outlet":"Al Jazeera","title":"Anthropic starts trading in the US after blockbuster IPO","perspective":"–","read":true,"readable":true},{"n":3,"url":"https://www.hindustantimes.com/world-news/us-news/anthropic-stock-jumps-34-in-nasdaq-debut-hits-2-trillion-valuation-as-ai-shares-rally-101795108731889.html","outlet":"Hindustan Times","title":"Anthropic stock jumps 34% in Nasdaq debut, hits $2 trillion valuation as AI shares rally","perspective":"–","read":true,"readable":true},{"n":4,"url":"https://www.france24.com/en/business/20261119-anthropic-begins-trading-1-5-trillion-company-biggest-ipo-record-ai","outlet":"France 24","title":"🔴Anthropic soars more than 30% to $2 trillion valuation on first day of trading","perspective":"–","read":true,"readable":true},{"n":5,"url":"https://www.dw.com/en/anthropic-trading-tests-investors-appetite-for-ai/a-79993163?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-rdf","outlet":"DW","title":"Anthropic trading tests in