81 Billion IPO Tops SpaceX as the Biggest on Record","perspective":"–","read":false,"readable":true}],"other_coverage":[{"text":"SpaceX debuted on the stock market in June 2026, raising $75 billion at a valuation of about $1.77 trillion.","ids":[150078],"class":"single","sources":[7]},{"text":"SpaceX raised $75 billion in its June IPO at a valuation of $1.77 trillion.","ids":[150084],"class":"single","sources":[6]},{"text":"Anthropic has $6.2 billion in debt.","ids":[150046],"class":"unverified","sources":[1,4,5]},{"text":"Dario Amodei acknowledged concerns about AI causing labour disruptions and cybersecurity problems.","ids":[150053],"class":"single","sources":[8]},{"text":"About 80 researchers, executives, and academics called Anthropic reckless.","ids":[150055],"class":"single","sources":[8]},{"text":"OpenAI is expected to stage its IPO next year.","ids":[150057],"class":"single","sources":[8]},{"text":"Nvidia invested a total of $20 billion in Anthropic.","ids":[150061],"class":"single","sources":[2]},{"text":"Anthropic reported a net loss of $104 billion in the first nine months of 2026.","ids":[150062],"class":"single","sources":[2]},{"text":"Anthropic's SEC filing warned that its AI systems could pose catastrophic or existential risks to humanity.","ids":[150064],"class":"single","sources":[2]},{"text":"A group of AI safety experts released a statement criticizing Anthropic's commitment to safe AI development.","ids":[150065],"class":"single","sources":[2]},{"text":"Investors showed strong demand for AI shares.","ids":[150070],"class":"single","sources":[3]},{"text":"Anthropic is unprofitable under standard accounting rules.","ids":[150075],"class":"single","sources":[4]},{"text":"Nvidia chief executive Jensen Huang resigned after admitting to an affair with a woman believed by US intelligence to be a Chinese spy.","ids":[150085],"class":"single","sources":[6]},{"text":"Anthropic is the first big AI company to go public.","ids":[150092],"class":"single","sou